===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|kʷŕ̥mis}}
Late {{inh|en|enm|cremesyn}}, from obsolete {{der|en|fr|cramoisin}} or {{der|en|osp|cremesín}}, from {{der|en|ar|قِرْمِز}}, from {{der|en|fa-cls|کرمست|tr=kirmist}}, from {{der|en|pal|-}}; see {{der|en|iir-pro|*kŕ̥miš}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|कृमिज}}.  Doublet of {{m|en|kermes}}; also see {{m|en|carmine}}.

