===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*(s)ker- (turn)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|creste}}, from {{der|en|fro|creste}} (modern {{m+|fr|crête}}) and perhaps continuing {{inh|en|ang|cræsta|t=crest, tuft, plume}}; both ultimately from {{der|en|la-vul|*cresta}}, from {{der|en|la|crista}}. {{doublet|en|crista}}.

The informal meaning “design, logo” ({{senseno|en|logo}}) stems from a misinterpretation of the heraldic {{senseno|en|heraldry}}, which specifically refers to the object placed on top of the helm.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/kɹɛst/}}
